title: Windows Update Tracker: Pending reboot
agents: windows
catalog: os/misc
license: GPLv2
distribution: https://github.com/KeksDipp/checkmk-plugins
description:
 Shows whether Windows needs a reboot to finish installing updates, and
 since when. Default: {WARN} after 1 day, {CRIT} after 3 days.
 With "No levels" the service always stays {OK}.

discovery:
 One service is created if the agent plugin output is present.
